symptoms with autoimmune origin to respond to intravenous
immunoglobin (IvIg).
3-5 We offered this therapy to our patient
at intervals of 4 weeks. After 3 cycles of IvIg (0.4 g/kg body
weight/day at 5 consecutive days) the orthostatic tolerance was
